{"resourceIdentifier":"4784","resourceName":"Wuhan Jiangxia Changshankou LFG Power Project Phase I","description":"Wuhan Jiangxia Changshankou LFG Power Project Phase I (hereafter referred to as the Project ””) is a landfill gas (LFG) recovery and utilization project d is located at\r\nChangshankou Landfill Jinkou Street Jiangxia District, Wuhan City, Hubei province, People’s Republic of China.\r\nPrior to the implementation of the project activity, the LFG generated from Changshankou Landfill was totally released into the atmosphere; the equivalent amount of electricity supplied by the project activity was supplied by the fossil-fuel-dominated Central China Power Grid (CCPG). The baseline scenario is the same as the conditions existing prior to the implementation of the project activity.\r\nThe Project achieves emission reductions in two aspects: 1) it avoids methane emissions by capturing and destroying LFG which would have been directly vented into the atmosphere in the baseline scenario; 2) it reduces CO2 emissions by displacing part of the electricity that would otherwise have been supplied by CCPG.","location":{"latitude":30.352775,"longitude":114.209164},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-11-10","endExclusive":"2023-12-11","endInclusive":"2023-12-10"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4784"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hubei"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Wuhan Huantou Environmental Technology Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Hubei Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4784"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"315624"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Energy industries (renewable/non-renewable sources)"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"China Classification Society Certification Company (CCSC)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"13/08/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 10/03/2022 - 09/03/2032"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=101498&IDKEY=nq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhj139965742","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"03-Changshankou_VCS Listing Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-11-02T03:24:55.527Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=101980&IDKEY=lkjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj9098140630420","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_PCP_4784_20OCT2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-11-10T18:44:18.667Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=117229&IDKEY=j0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9l161658791","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"05-Changshankou-VCS JointB PD&MR_20220310-20230831-1st round--clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-08-12T23:59:51.71Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=107993&IDKEY=akjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj909j148922347","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"08-Changshankou_Registration Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-02-22T15:18:02.723Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=117227&IDKEY=flksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku